# Raw Tiny Swords asset pack. The trimmed PNGs the app actually loads live
# under apps/web/public/units/ and ARE tracked; PIXEL/ is the source pack
# you'd pull from to regenerate sheets or add new units — too large
# (~5 MB of raw assets) to keep in git.
PIXEL/

# Tauri Rust build output (only the source + config under src-tauri/
# are tracked; target/ is reproducible from cargo).
apps/web/src-tauri/target/
apps/web/src-tauri/gen/

# Claude Code local state (worktrees, hooks)
.claude/

# Large binaries — Tauri sidecar Node runtime and release archives
apps/web/src-tauri/binaries/
*.zip

# Agent Office spawns per-agent git worktrees here — never commit them
.worktrees/

# Internal per-session handoff + planning notes — not for public repo
NEXT_SESSION.md
.specs/
.design/

# Tauri Node sidecar bundle — regenerated by `next build` (standalone) at package time.
apps/web/src-tauri/server/

# Screenshot-generation scratch (scripts + working shots) — the README images live in screenshots/
.showcase/
